-- **Counter-probe: the entry rule passes and the LINKER refuses.**
--
-- The entry is there, `pub`, and takes no argument -- so the entry rule says nothing. What no unit of
-- this build defines is `nirgendwo_definiert`. *This is the probe that the binder runs at all*,
-- rebuilt after the entry rule took the case the old one stood on.
compiler cc -std=c11 -O0 -Wall -Wextra -Werror
out      target/bau-eintritt-ungebunden

unit ungebunden program
    messung/proben/probe-eintritt-ungebunden.gab
